{
  "name": "dsh-adapter-compat",
  "version": "1.1.0",
  "description": "DSH LLM adapter 兼容垫片 + 自动压缩硬闸：回填缺失的 LlmAdapter 基类默认方法（imageRequestPricing 等）修复 /compact 静默失败；并把引擎 compactIfNeeded 恒置为无需压缩，从代码层彻底关闭自动压缩（手动 /compact 不受影响）。独立于任何被保护插件——不改它的文件，它的自更新/强制更新无法移除本修复；也与配置文件无关，cordis.patch.yml 被覆盖也不失效。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE",
    "test"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "adapter",
    "compat",
    "compact",
    "llm"
  ],
  "author": "EvelynShiao",
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/EvelynShiao/dsh-adapter-compat.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/EvelynShiao/dsh-adapter-compat#readme",
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node --test test/"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  }
}
